      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Replies from Mom, Dad and the family\nEvery text sent to the Dose Circle number lands here. Chest pain, falls, trouble breathing, an extra dose, STOP and START are caught by fixed rules first, so an emergency never waits on the AI.\n\nEverything else goes to Claude, which only describes the message: taken, partly taken with which pill, later, a reading, running low, not feeling well, or a question. The answer itself comes from tested rules and the real medicine list. Claude never gives medical advice.",
